      "id": "table:sql/cloud/1_damai_cloud_create_database.sql",
      "type": "table",
      "name": "1_damai_cloud_create_database.sql",
      "filePath": "sql/cloud/1_damai_cloud_create_database.sql",
      "summary": "云环境数据库初始化脚本，以 utf8mb4 字符集创建 damai_base_data、damai_customize、damai_order_0/1、damai_pay_0/1、damai_program_0/1、damai_user_0/1 共 10 个分库，是所有建表脚本的前置依赖。",
      "tags": ["database", "初始化脚本", "分库分表", "DDL"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "使用 CREATE DATABASE IF NOT EXISTS 保证脚本可重复执行，10 个库名与后端的 ShardingSphere 分片数据源一一对应。"
    },
    {
      "id": "table:sql/cloud/damai_base_data.sql",
      "type": "table",
      "name": "damai_base_data.sql",
      "filePath": "sql/cloud/damai_base_data.sql",
      "summary": "基础数据服务库 damai_base_data 的结构脚本，定义地区字典表 d_area 与第三方渠道密钥配置表 d_channel_data。",
      "tags": ["database", "基础数据", "字典表", "渠道对接"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "table:sql/cloud/damai_base_data.sql:d_area",
      "type": "table",
      "name": "d_area",
      "filePath": "sql/cloud/damai_base_data.sql",
      "summary": "地区表，通过 parent_id 自关联组织省/区/县层级，type 标记层级（1 省、2 区、3 县），municipality 标记直辖市，并对 parent_id 与 type 建立索引。",
      "tags": ["database", "字典表", "地区层级", "基础数据"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "table:sql/cloud/damai_base_data.sql:d_channel_data",
