      "name": "d_channel_data",
      "filePath": "sql/cloud/damai_base_data.sql",
      "summary": "渠道数据表，保存渠道名称、编码、简介以及签名公私钥、AES 密钥、数据加解密密钥与 token 密钥，供第三方渠道报文验签与加解密使用。",
      "tags": ["database", "渠道对接", "密钥配置", "security"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "table:sql/cloud/damai_customize.sql",
      "type": "table",
      "name": "damai_customize.sql",
      "filePath": "sql/cloud/damai_customize.sql",
      "summary": "定制化服务库 damai_customize 的结构脚本，定义接口调用埋点表 d_api_data 以及一般规则表 d_rule、深度规则表 d_depth_rule，构成接口限流黑名单的基础数据。",
      "tags": ["database", "定制服务", "限流", "规则配置"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "table:sql/cloud/damai_customize.sql:d_api_data",
      "type": "table",
      "name": "d_api_data",
      "filePath": "sql/cloud/damai_customize.sql",
      "summary": "接口调用数据表，记录客户端 IP、请求方法/路径/参数、请求体与调用时间，并按天/小时/分钟/秒四个维度建索引，用于接口调用统计与限流规则匹配（type 区分一般规则与深度规则）。",
      "tags": ["database", "api监控", "限流统计", "定制服务"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "table:sql/cloud/damai_customize.sql:d_depth_rule",
